  <Document>
    <name>Southwest Canyons &amp; California Coast Road Trip (LAS → LAX · Nov 2–12, 2026)</name>
    <description>Post-NYC Marathon 11-day / 10-night Southwest Canyons &amp; Southern California Coast loop: Las Vegas, Valley of Fire, Zion, Bryce Canyon, Buckskin Gulch, Page &amp; Antelope Canyon, Monument Valley, Grand Canyon, Sedona, Joshua Tree, Laguna Beach, Venice, Santa Monica, Malibu &amp; LAX.</description>
